      "content": "i mean i get the difference in interpretation but you calling it a \"clear victory for conservative legal thought\" sounds like you're taking a side. pretty sure the dissenters thought their logic was solid too. shouldn't a legal summary just stick to what each side argued without saying one is \"flawed\" or \"a victory\"?",
